msgid "**Example \"How to use Rotoscoping for Changing Color Tone\"**"
msgstr "**Príklad „Ako použiť rotoskopiu na zmenu farebného tónu\"**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:243
msgid "Layout changed to Color"
msgstr "Rozloženie zmenené na Farba"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:245
msgid ""
"We will be using the :guilabel:`Color` layout. This will allow us to work "
"with the color vectorscope. Make sure it is enabled: :menuselection:`Menu --"
"> View --> Vectorscope`. But for now we will stay in the :guilabel:`Edit` "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"Budeme používať rozloženie :guilabel:`Farba`. To nám umožní pracovať s "
"farebným vektoroskopom. Uistite sa, že je povolený: :menuselection:`Menu --> "
"Zobrazenie --> Vektoroskop`. Ale zatiaľ zostaneme v rozložení :guilabel:"
"`Upraviť`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:254
msgid "Selecting Rotoscoping from the list of effects"
msgstr "Výber Rotoskopie zo zoznamu efektov"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:256
msgid ""
"In the Timeline, select the clip with the sunset. Open the effects tab, type "
"in \"Rotoscoping\", then drag it over the video to see further instructions."
msgstr ""
"Na časovej osi vyberte klip so západom slnka. Otvorte záložku efektov, "
"zadajte „Rotoskopia\", potom ho pretiahnite na video, aby ste videli ďalšie "
"pokyny."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:265
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:276
msgid "Object selection"
msgstr "Výber objektu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:267
msgid ""
"Start creating the region/mask around the sun by putting nodes around it. "
"Use :guilabel:`Mouse left-click` to create nodes. If needed, zoom into the "
"Project Monitor by using :guilabel:`Ctrl+Wheel` or the Project Monitor "
"controls."
msgstr ""
"Začnite vytvárať oblasť/masku okolo slnka umiestnením uzlov okolo neho. Na "
"vytvorenie uzlov použite :guilabel:`Ľavé tlačidlo myši`. V prípade potreby "
"priblížte Monitor projektu pomocou :guilabel:`Ctrl+Wheel` alebo ovládacích "
"prvkov Monitora projektu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:278
msgid ""
"Close the region/mask by :guilabel:`Mouse right-click`. If needed make "
"adjustments by moving, adding or deleting nodes. For round object like the "
"sun in this example curves come in handy."
msgstr ""
"Uzavrite oblasť/masku pomocou :guilabel:`Pravého tlačidla myši`. V prípade "
"potreby vykonajte úpravy presunutím, pridaním alebo odstránením uzlov. Pre "
"okrúhle objekty, ako je slnko v tomto príklade, sú krivky veľmi užitočné."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:287
msgid "YUV selection"
msgstr "Výber YUV"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:289
msgid ""
"Switch back to the :guilabel:`Color` layout. In the vectorscope tab use the :"
"guilabel:`Paint mode` and select YUV."
msgstr ""
"Prepnite späť na rozloženie :guilabel:`Farba`. Na záložke vektoroskopu "
"použite :guilabel:`Režim maľovania` a vyberte YUV."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:298
msgid "Color balance selection"
msgstr "Výber vyváženia farieb"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/rotoscoping.rst:300
msgid ""
"In the effects tab choose Color Balance and adjust the various red, green "
"and blue values to the color of the sun you like."
msgstr ""
"Na záložke efektov vyberte Vyváženie farieb a upravte rôzne hodnoty "
"červenej, zelenej a modrej na farbu slnka, ktorá sa vám páči."

