msgid ""
"If there is no keyframe ruler in the Rotoscope effect panel click on the |"
"keyframe| icon in the effect header"
msgstr ""
"Ak sa v paneli efektu Rotoskopia nenachádza pravítko keyframe-ov, kliknite "
"na ikonu |keyframe| v záhlaví efektu"

